# "Apri con…": the programs that can open the file.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/apri-con.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Down 13
Sleep 600ms
Alt+o
Sleep 2500ms
